Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","review_id":"xicL8Kib0L2Ef9WRir1T5g","date":"2019-11-18T18:40:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9473100304603577,"text_excerpt":"Damn Sofia, I had such a great time at brunch that I needed a few days to figure out how to properly give y'all justice. My sister was in town visiting with one of our family friends and we were all in the mood for a hearty and rich in flavor brunch. We wanted a mix of a fun and great environment, amazing and decadent dishes, but the casualness of wearing jeans and a sweater. Clearly we weren't asking for too much lol. Well Sofia came to mind and after showing them a few pics from yelp (woot woot) it was finalized that this was our brunch destination for that day. We had a bit of a late start for brunch which worked out in our favor because we were promptly seated. Our table started off w..."},{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","review_id":"VBzr5_lVPn7rVWa7-MfgqQ","date":"2021-05-26T14:39:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9422223567962646,"text_excerpt":"Sofia I hope you never ever stop being amazing. Literally so good, as always. Last night's ventures had us trying a couple new things, like the Margherita Pizza (had previously gotten the spicy, soo spicy!) and Cacio e Pepe pasta. Both were AMAZING. The cacio might replace the a la vodka pasta as my favorite. The Margherita pizza was thin and tasty and the sauce wasn't too overpowering. House ricotta and meatballs are two of my favorite apps in the city. Service from Bo was great too! Atmosphere and ambiance are always 5/5 too. If you haven't visited yet WYD?"},{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","review_id":"-HnBaPfrSO8LcjyfLrGY-Q","date":"2019-05-28T20:55:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9394100904464722,"text_excerpt":"Tried out Sofia Nola this past weekend when my best friend and her husband were in town to visit. She was interested in the menu mainly due to the blue crab risotto and because the restaurant was named after Sofia Loren (one of her idols). I'd recommend making a reservation, especially on a weekend, because it's a smaller restaurant and seating looked limited. I liked the open wood fired pizza oven and trendy ambiance. Some reviewers have mentioned that the music doesn't go with an Italian restaurant since it was hip hop, but whatever. It worked for me since it was a modern vibe and not your traditional Italian joint. We shared several dishes: -Crispy potatoes -Kale salad -Tagliarini/squi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","photo_id":"5f9NnrxeuXBGC6vBW7EYmA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5f9NnrxeuXBGC6vBW7EYmA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8548929691314697},{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","photo_id":"flI6ztOvwMV0EO5tu7AOiw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/flI6ztOvwMV0EO5tu7AOiw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8488176465034485},{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","photo_id":"ip9GxOIo_f1zk35nmrQ91g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ip9GxOIo_f1zk35nmrQ91g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.842860221862793},{"business_id":"6_OAIFxSk3YjNdRJv59Saw","photo_id":"uul0ABKOdUovPikeUc77yg","label":"food","image_url":